      "node_id": "kg_doc_17",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Our Prayer\" is a wordless hymn composed by Brian Wilson for American rock band the Beach Boys. It was intended for the \"Smile\" album until the project was shelved. It was then released on their 1969 album \"20/20\" with additional production by the Beach Boys without involvement from Wilson. As a solo artist, Wilson rerecorded and released the piece on his 2004 version of \"Smile\" in medley with the 1953 doo-wop standard \"Gee\".",
