      "content": "``Pack Up Your Troubles in Your Old Kit - Bag, and Smile, Smile, Smile ''is the full name of a World War I marching song, published in 1915 in London. It was written by Welsh songwriter George Henry Powell under the pseudonym of`` George Asaf'', and set to music by his brother Felix Powell.",
